          "entradaId": "freeman-740",
          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "See also Matthew 15:5. The corban was an offering of any kind consecrated to God. It was right to make such offerings because God had commanded them; but the Saviour charges the Pharisees with placing their traditions above the Divine commands. For instance, God ordained honor an…"
      }
